(2, 1, '2020-05-15 03:33:42', '2020-05-15 03:33:42', 'We Provide Annual Maintenance Contract For All Types Of Automatic Systems From Motorized Barriers, Motorized Roof Slidings, Automatic Sliding Gate, Automatic Telescopic Gate. Soundproof Windows And Acoustic Movable Wall Partition And Doors Manufactured By Us.We have increased our service\'s strength and improved our service time.Our company has been standing in India for 35 years (as of 2020) and is known for its International Quality Products and Services Kiran Slido Craft\'s vision is to continuously improve Aluminum Sliding Door and Windows Manufacturing technologies and quality. Thanks to our best quality technologies and special designs for complete Sliding engineering products and services. We are among the few in the world that can provide customized products and services to suit every Sliding Door needs.', 'Our Services', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'open', '', 'our-services', '', '', '2020-05-26 15:46:51', '2020-05-26 15:46:51', '', 0, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/?page_id=2', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(3, 1, '2020-05-15 03:33:42', '2020-05-15 03:33:42', 'We are proud to offer Soundproof Windows, which are designed in accordance with international standards. The exceptional soundproof windows offered by us have carved niche for themselves in the market backed by unique construction design. Give high dB Reduction of sound by our Soundproof Windows make them ultimate choice available in the market. All Sound Resistance windows design and build by Kiran Slido Craft provide optimum performance, in our manufacturing process we also take care about insulation of aluminum sections by filling the inner cavity of the section to provide best sound reduction. All sound reduction window are double glass and are specially made as per our standards for best quality product is provided to your costumers. New series slim series of windows available.Kiran Slido Craft provide complete sliding window solution form regular series to slim series form Indian to Imported sectional profiles  manual to motorized Sliding sound proof windows.		\n			<h2>Material of Construction</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Aluminum extrusion\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Insulated glass\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Insulation materials \n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Can Block Sound up to</h2>		\n		STC 30db to 52db		\n			<h2>Specialty</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Heavy Duty\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Long Life\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Made as per international Standards\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Easy to install, maintain and operate\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Controls Sound up to high decibel levels\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Complete Customization Option \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										COLOUR TYPE: Anodized and PP COLOUR  ( PURE POLISTER ) \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										COLOUR OPTION: As per clients wish.\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Widely Used In Places Like</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Residential Applications\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Commercial Centers\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Industrial establishments\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Multiplexes\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Malls\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Theaters\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Conference Halls\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n										<img width=\"724\" height=\"924\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/technical-details.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/technical-details.jpg 724w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/technical-details-235x300.jpg 235w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/technical-details-600x766.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 724px) 100vw, 724px\" />											\n										<img width=\"724\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/btu-loss.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/btu-loss.jpg 724w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/btu-loss-300x124.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/btu-loss-600x249.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 724px) 100vw, 724px\" />											\n		[product_categories number=\"3\" columns=\"3\" hide_empty=\"0\" orderby=\"name\" order=\"desc\" ids=\"163,164\"]', 'WINDOW SYSTEM', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'open', '', 'window-system', '', '', '2020-06-01 18:32:04', '2020-06-01 18:32:04', '', 0, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/?page_id=3', 0, 'page', '', 0),
