(840, 1, '2019-06-05 16:07:49', '2019-06-05 16:07:49', 'The insulated retractable sliding glass roof systems we provide are well known for their reliability. The roof system can be found in commercial buildings, restaurants, cafés, sport halls, hockey arenas, palaces, private houses, public buildings etc. The customer who is looking for a sliding glass roof is usually have a project visualized, and don’t want to be limited by conventional skylights or roof windows.The insulated sliding roof is very versatile and can have multiple functions, such as : 		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Covering an enclosed area, 75% retractable\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Resting on top of structure, 100% retractable\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										A gazebo, used as the full roof structure of the gazebo\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Terrace entrance, can be used as a hatch in the roof to enter the roof area\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										This video explains some of the sliding glass roof features\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>INSTALLATION TIME COMPARISON</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Complete roof with conventional roof windows\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Complete roof without any windows\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Sliding glass roof\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										A normal roof needs a lot of materials and work; wood, roofing felt, insulation material, inner ceiling, windows, sanding, painting, etc.\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Our sliding glass roofs are premade custom, according to your measurements.\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Installation time on site is minimized and saves you money!\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Material Use</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Aluminium Extrusion \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										S.S. Framework\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Indian Made heavy duty cycle motors \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Or\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Imported European Standard Motors\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Weatherproof \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Dust Proof\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										IP Rated\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Overheat Protection\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Types Available </h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Double Slide \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Single Slide\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Specialty</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Skylight \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Pool Covers\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Double Slide product displays\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										and many other applications depending on client’s requirement\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Framework Types</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Aluminum Extrusion\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Stainless Steel Framework\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Widely As</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Residential Applications\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Commercial Centres\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Industrial establishments\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Malls\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Conference Halls\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TMAZZ08cd-khttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-M1OiThaWV4		\n			<h2>SS Framework Motorized Roof Sliding Export Variant </h2>		\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GykD_SLJmNE', 'Motorized Aluminium Frame', 'We are a Manufacturer, Exporter & Supplier of Motorized Sliding Roof. The product offer is high in quality and durability. It is widely used in varied industries for multiple purposes.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'motorized-aluminium-frame', '', '', '2020-07-01 20:00:40', '2020-07-01 20:00:40', '', 0, 'http://demos.reytheme.com/beijing/?post_type=product&#038;p=840', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(841, 1, '2019-06-05 16:07:53', '2019-06-05 16:07:53', '<h4>Material for Construction</h4>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Aluminum Extrusion\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Heavy Duty Mechanism\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										For Motor ( Imported Motor ) specification will depend on design \r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h4>Widely used in</h4>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Residential Applications\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Commercial Centers\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Industrial Establishments\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Multiplexes\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Malls\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Theaters\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Conference Halls\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=30MC-u2PCZc', 'Motorized Sound Proof Window', 'Our expertise lies in offering a qualitative range of Motorized Sliding Windows. \r\n\r\nThe Motorized Sliding Windows that we offer are marked by superior quality, durability and excellent finish. Specification depends upon windows size and weight  \r\n', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'motorized-sound-proof-window', '', '', '2020-06-19 03:32:36', '2020-06-19 03:32:36', '', 0, 'http://demos.reytheme.com/beijing/?post_type=product&#038;p=841', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(843, 1, '2019-06-05 16:08:01', '2019-06-05 16:08:01', '<h4>Material of Construction</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Fire and Acoustical panel\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Aluminium Extrusions\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										PU Foam\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Insulation Material\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										MDF\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Sound Seal\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h4>Can Control Sounds up to</h4>		\n		Conference room STC 50dbBallroom STC 50db		\n			<h4>Widely Used At</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Conference Rooms\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Theatres\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Ball Rooms\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Clubs\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Board Rooms\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Presentation Centers\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JpL3CS2cmGghttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hYVgFDKY82o', 'Acoustic Movable Partition', 'Soundproof Movable Partition/Walls is Beneficial for Reduction of Sound or Vibration Emitted from Walls.\r\n\r\nMovable sound-proof partition walls are characterized by modular elements having high acoustic insulation they are easily stored and slide quietly along guide rails fixed only into the ceiling. Designed to harmonize with the existing architectural style they can reach any length and height up to 4mtrs with covering in a choice of materials and finish. High-level technology guarantees quality and reliability while offering the ideal solution for a rapid, physical and acoustic division of areas destined to host large events, meetings, workshops, videoconferences and training sessions.\r\n', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'acoustic-movable-partition', '', '', '2020-06-19 04:42:03', '2020-06-19 04:42:03', '', 0, 'http://demos.reytheme.com/beijing/?post_type=product&#038;p=843', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(844, 1, '2019-06-05 16:08:04', '2019-06-05 16:08:04', '<table width=\"97%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>As per our internal test report we have successful achieved an sound rating of 41 to 59db available <strong>STC-54 FLUSH</strong>\r\nCommunicating doors, Two STC-40 Doors Installed back-to-back in common frame.\r\nDouble  300 series bottom seal &amp; top seal for each door.\r\n(1220 x 3050 mm), wood or high pressure decorative laminate faced.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>100% Noise Reduction?</strong>\r\nWhile <strong>Soundproof Windows/door</strong> cannot eliminate 100% of the noise, it will be reduced very significantly. Less noise will be coming through the <strong>Soundproof Windows/door</strong> than the walls in many cases. Most walls are an STC 42-43: Soundproof Windows usually have an STC rating of 45-54. Several things can be done to increase the STC rating even more.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>All <strong>Kiran Slido Craft</strong> Acoustical Doors are (54 mm) thick and may be used with normal hardware. STC-28 doors weigh the same as most regular solid core doors while the STC-39 through STC-45 doors are slightly heavier. Door weight and usage should be considered when selecting frames and hardware. Full mortise hinges and either cylindrical or mortise type locks may be used. The maximum Benefit of acoustical doors is provided from openings with uniform door/frame edge clearance, correct positioning of gasket, and proper adjustment of the automatic bottom seal.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Sound Proof Openable Door', 'Proactively communicate corporate process improvements via corporate scenarios. Progressively aggregate proactive data after diverse users. Rapidiously redefine front-end interfaces before go forward process improvements.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'sound-proof-openable-door', '', '', '2020-06-05 19:00:04', '2020-06-05 19:00:04', '', 0, 'http://demos.reytheme.com/beijing/?post_type=product&#038;p=844', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(845, 1, '2019-06-05 16:08:07', '2019-06-05 16:08:07', '<h4>Benefits :  </h4>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Energy Saving\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Heavy Duty Hardware\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Best Sound Reduction\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Low Maintenance\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Airtight Sealing And Weatherproof\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Perfect Fit For Home, Offices and Resturants\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h4>Section Type : Aluminium </h4>		\r\n			<h4>Glass : Double Glass </h4>		\r\n			<h4>System Operation : Manual</h4>		\r\n			<h4>Type : Sliding Doors</h4>		\r\n			<h4>Widely Used In Places Like</h4>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Hotels\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Restaurants\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Residences\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Offices\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GOh7XYZ1HZM', 'Sound Proof Sliding Door', 'In modern workspace design, there’s a strong focus on transparency and economy of space. All-glass partition walls let daylight into working areas and hallways. Yet planners also need spaces insulated from environmental noise.\r\n\r\n<h4>Superior sound proofing to sound insulation class</h4> \r\n\r\nComplementing the transparency of our all-glass partition walls, we now offer an innovative all-glass sliding door system with advanced soundproofing. \r\n', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'sound-proof-sliding-door', '', '', '2020-06-19 04:25:39', '2020-06-19 04:25:39', '', 0, 'http://demos.reytheme.com/beijing/?post_type=product&#038;p=845', 0, 'product', '', 0),
