s else swing the complete sash inward and use it as your standard window. High-grade  Aluminium Frame coupled with Glass of choice offers various configurations of tilt-turn windows.  ', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'sound-proof-tilt-and-turn-window', '', '', '2020-06-24 04:59:11', '2020-06-24 04:59:11', '', 0, 'http://demos.reytheme.com/beijing/?post_type=product&#038;p=846', 0, 'product', '', 0),
