(1267, 1, '2020-05-19 07:33:50', '2020-05-19 07:33:50', 'Kiran Slido Craft, a sole-proprietary concern was established in 1985 by Mr. Tapan Chakraborty. We strive to provide best quality products and services following the Belief of Make In India for past 35 years.We provide Manufacturing and Services for Motorized Sliding Systems and Acoustic System (Doors, Windows, Partitions). From Customized solutions for various individual clients to industries, we have been Engineering our products to suit their requirements. This supports our moto: “To bring Peace and Tranquility to your Home”  We have been growing and improving our products for You, our customers.\nWe are a leading products and manufacturing company, we understand the change in current needs and strive hard to make that change reach You, our customers without compromising on Quality.\nWe offer high-quality products that reflect our goal to bring our customers leading technologies in Interior Engineering. 		\n										<img width=\"1699\" height=\"1536\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p.jpg 1699w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-300x271.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-1024x926.jpg 1024w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-768x694.jpg 768w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-1536x1389.jpg 1536w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-600x542.jpg 600w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05