(1323, 1, '2020-05-26 17:52:54', '2020-05-26 17:52:54', '<h5>Material of Construction</h5>\r\n', 'Sound Proof Windows', 'We are proud to offer Soundproof Windows, which are designed in accordance with international standards. The exceptional soundproof windows offered by us have carved niche for themselves in the market backed by unique construction design. Give high dB Reduction of sound by our Soundproof Windows make them ultimate choice available in the market. \r\n\r\nAll Sound Resistance windows design and build by Kiran Slido Craft provide optimum performance, in our manufacturing process we also take care about insulation of aluminum sections by filling the inner cavity of the section to provide best sound reduction. All sound reduction window are double glass and are specially made as per our standards for best quality product is provided to your costumers. New series slim series of windows available.\r\n\r\nKiran Slido Craft provide complete sliding window solution form regular series to slim series form Indian to Imported sectional profiles  manual to motorized Sliding sound proof windows.\r\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '850-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-05-26 17:52:54', '2020-05-26 17:52:54', '', 850, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/850-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
