(1364, 1, '2020-05-27 06:45:00', '2020-05-27 06:45:00', '<h4>Material of Construction</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Aluminum extrusion</li>\r\n 	<li>Insulated glass</li>\r\n 	<li>Insulation materials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Can Block Sound up to</h4>\r\nSTC 30db to 52db\r\n<h4>Specialty</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Heavy Duty</li>\r\n 	<li>Long Life</li>\r\n 	<li>Made as per international Standards</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install, maintain and operate</li>\r\n 	<li>Controls Sound up to high decibel levels</li>\r\n 	<li>Complete Customization Option</li>\r\n 	<li>COLOUR TYPE: Anodized and PP COLOUR ( PURE POLISTER )</li>\r\n 	<li>COLOUR OPTION: As per clients wish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Widely Used In Places Like</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Residential Applications</li>\r\n 	<li>Commercial Centers</li>\r\n 	<li>Industrial establishments</li>\r\n 	<li>Multiplexes</li>\r\n 	<li>Malls</li>\r\n 	<li>Theaters</li>\r\n 	<li>Conference Halls</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Sound Proof Sliding Window', 'We are proud to offer Soundproof Windows, which are designed in accordance with international standards. The exceptional soundproof windows offered by us have carved niche for themselves in the market backed by unique construction design. Give high dB Reduction of sound by our Soundproof Windows make them ultimate choice available in the market.\r\n\r\nAll Sound Resistance windows design and build by Kiran Slido Craft provide optimum performance, in our manufacturing process we also take care about insulation of aluminum sections by filling the inner cavity of the section to provide best sound reduction. All sound reduction window are double glass and are specially made as per our standards for best quality product is provided to your costumers. New series slim series of windows available.\r\n\r\nKiran Slido Craft provide complete sliding window solution form regular series to slim series form Indian to Imported sectional profiles manual to motorized Sliding sound proof windows.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '850-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-05-27 06:45:00', '2020-05-27 06:45:00', '', 850, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/850-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
