(1404, 1, '2020-05-27 09:04:57', '2020-05-27 09:04:57', 'Material for Construction\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Aluminum extrusion</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty mechanism</li>\r\n<li>For Motor ( Imported Motor ) specification will depend on design</li>\r\n</ul> \r\n\r\nWidely used in\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Residential Applications</li>\r\n<li>Commercial Centers</li>\r\n<li>Industrial establishments</li>\r\n<li>Multiplexes</li>\r\n<li>Malls</li>\r\n<li>Theaters</li>\r\n<li>Conference Halls</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Motorized Sound Proof Window', 'Our expertise lies in offering a qualitative range of Motorized Sliding Windows. \r\nThe Motorized Sliding Windows that we offer are marked by superior quality, durability and excellent finish. Specification depends upon windows size and weight  \r\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '841-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-05-27 09:04:57', '2020-05-27 09:04:57', '', 841, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/841-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
