testing procedure, we conduct an Insulation test and sound transmitting test through, which guarantees the quality and performance of the products offered by us.		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						READ OUR STORY\n					</a>\n			<h4>JOIN THE CLUB</h4>		\n		<p>Get 10% off your first purchase by joining our mailing list, <br />and receive some of the best deals possible.</p>		\n			<!-- Mailchimp for WordPress v4.7.7 - https://wordpress.org/plugins/mailchimp-for-wp/ --><form id=\"mc4wp-form-1\" method=\"post\" data-id=\"102\" data-name=\"Newsletter form\" ><p>\n	<input type=\"email\" name=\"EMAIL\" placeholder=\"email address\" required />\n</p>\n<p>\n	<input type=\"submit\" value=\"JOIN NOW\" />\n</p><label style=\"display: none !important;\">Leave this field empty if you\'re human: <input type=\"text\" name=\"_mc4wp_honeypot\" value=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></label><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_mc4wp_timestamp\" value=\"1590635875\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_mc4wp_form_id\" value=\"102\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_mc4wp_form_element_id\" value=\"mc4wp-form-1\" /></form><!-- / Mailchimp for WordPress Plugin -->		\n			<h4>FOLLOW US</h4>		\n							<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Facebook\n									</a>\n							<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Instagram\n									</a>\n							<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Pinterest\n									</a>\n			<h4>GET THE CATALOGUE</h4>		\n		<p>Get a free copy of our catalogue, for your inspiration.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						REQUEST\n					</a>\n										<img width=\"400\" height=\"203\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/catalogue-lq.png\" alt=\"\" />											\n			<h4>Honesty and sustainability</h4>		\n			<h4>CHOSEN WITH CARE</h4>		\n		<p>Our furniture is made from natural materials, selected with consideration <br />and respec