385_HDR-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-768x576.jpg 768w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-600x450.jpg 600w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-800x600.jpg 800w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR.jpg 1632w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />											\n										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"792\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/about-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" />											\n			<h2>Quality</h2>		\n		Being a quality conscious organization, ‘KIRAN SLIDO CRAFT’ pays a lot of emphasis upon the quality of the product supplied by us. To ensure the exceptional quality of the products offered by us, we have designed an in house, a testing facility for products manufactured by us is tested. As part of the testing procedure, we conduct an Insulation test and sound transmitting test through, which guarantees the quality and performance of the products offered by us.For Motorized system or Automatic System, we have different methods which are recorded in terms of a duty cycle of the system 		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						READ MORE\n					</a>\n			<h4>JOIN THE CLUB</h4>		\n		<p>Get 10% off your first purchase by joining our mailing list, <br />and receive some of the best deals possible.</p>		\n			<!-- Mailchimp for WordPress v4.7.7 - https://wordpress.org/plugins/mailchimp-for-wp/ --><form id=\"mc4wp-form-1\" method=\"post\" data-id=\"102\