px) 100vw, 768px\" />											\n										<img width=\"176\" height=\"320\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/top-channel-sliding-doors-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/top-channel-sliding-doors-1.jpg 176w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/top-channel-sliding-doors-1-165x300.jpg 165w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 176px) 100vw, 176px\" />											\n			<h4>MOTORIZED SYSTEM</h4>		\n			<p>Casual multifunctional sofabeds with head elevation: a comfortable motorized system at daytime transforms into changes to a very comfortable bed at night.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product-category/motorized-system/\" role=\"button\">\n						SHOP NOW\n					</a>\n										<img width=\"640\" height=\"505\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/DSF-OpenAir-949_3125_01.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/DSF-OpenAir-949_3125_01.jpg 640w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/DSF-OpenAir-949_3125_01-300x237.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/DSF-OpenAir-949_3125_01-600x473.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />											\n										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2