imalistic-PTALS5T.jpg\" alt=\"\" />											\n										<img width=\"305\" height=\"232\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/at-the-classroom-P3CFGE2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />											\n										<img width=\"274\" height=\"307\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/the-interior-of-big-empty-modern-office-after-PGYCKPE.jpg\" alt=\"\" />											\n			<h4>STORIES</h4>		\n				<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/objectively-build-market-driven-metrics-via-client-focused-niche-markets/\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n					<img width=\"768\" height=\"403\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/img-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" />				</a>\n				By <a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/author/admin/\" title=\"Posts by admin\" rel=\"author\">admin</a><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/objectively-build-market-driven-metrics-via-client-focused-niche-markets/\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time datetime=\"2019-06-06T07:58:42+00:00\">June 6, 2019</time></a><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/objectively-build-market-driven-metrics-via-client-focused-niche-markets/#respond\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" > <use href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/themes/rey/assets/images/icons/icon-sprite.svg#rey-icon-comments\" xlink:href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/themes/rey/assets/images/icons/icon-sprite.svg#rey-icon-comments\"></use> </svg> 0</a>  on Objectively build market-driven metrics via client-focused niche markets<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-admin/post.php?post=981&#038;action=edit\">Edit Objectively build market-driven metrics via client-focused niche markets</a>				\n			<h3><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesoluti