(1673, 1, '2020-06-16 07:17:41', '2020-06-16 07:17:41', '<h2>Superior sound proofing to sound insulation class </h2>		\r\n		Complementing the transparency of our all-glass partition walls, we now offer an innovative all-glass sliding door system with advanced soundproofing.		\r\n			<h2>Sound Reduction Panel Fix Partition Made Of Panels Or Insulating Walls</h2>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Acoustic Wall Panel / Acoustic Board\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Insulation Forming and Sound Redution Materials and MDF Board (For Doors)\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Sound Seals\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h2>DGU GLASS FIX PARTITION</h2>		\r\n		Soundproof Walls. Made from insulation Material and sound reductions panels reduce the Echo effect and works as a sound dampener. Soundproof Walls offered by us high dB reduction of sound from the room. Designed for theatres, conference rooms, and other similar purposes, our Soundproof Walls have carved a niche for themselves in the market.Type Available: Glass or Sound Reduction Panels		\r\n			<h2>Material of Construction</h2>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Fire Rated soundproof panel\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Aluminium extrusions\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										PU Foam\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Insulation Material\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										DGU Glass \r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h2>Can Control Sounds up to</h2>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Conference room STC 50db\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Ballroom STC 50db\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h2>Widely Used At</h2>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Conference Rooms\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Theatres\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Ball Rooms\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Clubs\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Board Rooms\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Presentation Centres\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>', 'Sound Proof Partition', 'In modern workspace design, there’s a strong focus on transparency and economy of space. All-glass partition walls let daylight into working areas and hallways. Yet planners also need spaces insulated from environmental noise.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'sound-proof-partition', '', '', '2020-07-13 06:08:49', '2020-07-13 06:08:49', '', 0, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/?post_type=product&#038;p=1673', 0, 'product', '', 0),
