(1714, 1, '2020-06-16 15:29:14', '2020-06-16 15:29:14', '', 'Sound Proof Top Hung Window', 'Aluminium Tilt and Turn Windows are a great choice when it comes to choosing a window, as it has a perfect blend of intelligent operability and smart aesthetics. These windows provide you the flexibility of choosing it as a source of ventilation or as a standard window. Tilt the top of the sash and open inward at an angle to use it for ventilation purposes else swing the complete sash inward and use it as your standard window. High-grade Aluminium Frame coupled with Glass of choice offers various configurations of tilt-turn windows.  ', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '847-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-06-16 15:29:14', '2020-06-16 15:29:14', '', 847, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/847-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
