(1789, 1, '2020-06-18 05:01:54', '2020-06-18 05:01:54', '<h4>Material of Construction</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										3 Phase Controller\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Motor\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Aluminum Boom\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h4>Can Block Sound up to</h4>		\n		STC 30db to 52db		\n			<h4>Specialty</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Heavy Duty\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Long Life\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Made as per international Standards\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Easy to install, maintain and operate\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Controls Sound up to high decibel levels\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Complete Customization Option \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										COLOUR TYPE: Anodized and PP COLOUR (PURE POLYESTER)\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										COLOUR OPTION: As per client’s requirement\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h4>Widely Used In Places Like</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Residential Applications\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Commercial Centers\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Industrial Establishments\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Multiplexes\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Malls\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Theaters\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Conference Halls\n									</li>\n						</ul>', 'Motorized Barrier System', 'We specialize in Motorized Barrier System, which are in wide demand in international as well as domestic market due to its unique construction design. The easy to operate Motorized Barrier System offered by us have been made in accordance with international standards and are therefore highly preferred by our clients. The heavy-duty Motorized Barrier System manufactured and supplied by us are used as a security gate in commercial, industrial and residential properties.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '',