(1793, 1, '2020-06-18 05:10:12', '2020-06-18 05:10:12', '', 'Motorized Sliding Gates', 'We are proud to offer world class Automatic Sliding Gates and Telescopic gate that are made from Best quality materials which offer durable and strong structure to them. Fitted with an efficient 3 phase motor and Single Phase motor depending on Requirement, the Automatic Sliding Gates offered by us have automatic operations and are easy to operate.\r\n\r\nAutomatic Gate System’s primary intention is to disallow unauthorized intruders into the premises using active or passive security devices. Sophisticated security control systems have been developed to meet customer specific requirements.\r\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1685-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-06-18 05:10:12', '2020-06-18 05:10:12', '', 1685, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/1685-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
