(1803, 1, '2020-06-19 02:58:11', '2020-06-19 02:58:11', '<strong>Vertical Sliding windows or Sash windows are mostly made for places were there very limited space.</strong>All Sound Resistance windows design and build by Kiran Slido Craft provide optimum performance, in our manufacturing process we also take care about insulation of aluminum sections by filling the inner cavity of the section to provide best sound reduction. All sound reduction window are double glass and are specially made as per our standards for best quality product is provided to your costumers. New series slim series of windows available.Kiran Slido Craft provide complete sliding window solution form regular series to slim series form Indian to Imported sectional profiles  manual to motorized Sliding sound proof windows.		\n			<h2>Material of Construction</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Aluminum extrusion\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Insulated glass\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Insulation materials \n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Can Block Sound up to</h2>		\n		STC 30db to 52db		\n			<h2>Specialty</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Heavy Duty\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Long Life\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Made as per international Standards\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Easy to install, maintain and operate\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Controls Sound up to high decibel levels\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Complete Customization Option \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										COLOUR TYPE: Anodized and PP COLOUR  ( PURE POLISTER ) \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										COLOUR OPTION: As per clients wish.\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Widely Used In Places Like</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Residential Applications\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Commercial Centers\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Industrial establishments\n									</li