(1826, 1, '2020-06-19 04:01:07', '2020-06-19 04:01:07', 'Material Use \r\n\r\nAluminum Extrusion \r\nor\r\nS.S. Frame Work\r\n\r\nMotor type\r\n\r\nIndia Made heavy duty cycle motors \r\nor \r\nImported European Standard Motors COMPACT \r\n\r\nTypes Available \r\n\r\nDouble Slide\r\nSingle Slide\r\n\r\nFrame Work Types \r\n\r\nAluminum Extrusion\r\nOR\r\nStainless Steel Frame Work\r\n\r\nSpecialty\r\n\r\nSkylight\r\nPool Covers\r\nDouble Slide product displays\r\nAnd many other applications depending on clients requirement\r\n\r\nWidely As\r\n\r\nResidential Applications\r\nCommercial Centers\r\nIndustrial establishments\r\nMalls\r\n', 'Sound Proof Sliding Folding Door', 'Our profiles systems have in all bifold doors and windows Series peripheral compensators, inner frames with embedded or superposed option. Our profile systems for Bifold Doors admit to place different glasses as monolithic, laminated, chambers.\r\n\r\nWide range of aluminium products; aluminium sheets, sandwich panels and aluminium profiles (square, round and rectangular tubes, flat bars, angles and corner tubes) in a standard size.\r\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1687-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-06-19 04:01:07', '2020-06-19 04:01:07', '', 1687, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/1687-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
