(1847, 1, '2020-06-19 04:23:43', '2020-06-19 04:23:43', '<h4>Benefits :  </h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Energy Saving\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Heavy Duty Hardware\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Best Sound Reduction\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Low Maintenance\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Airtight Sealing And Weatherproof\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Perfect Fit For Home, Offices and Resturants\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h4>Section Type : Aluminium </h4>		\n			<h4>Glass : Double Glass </h4>		\n			<h4>System Operation : Manual</h4>		\n			<h4>Type : Sliding Doors</h4>		\n			<h4>Widely Used In Places Like</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Hotels\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Restaurants\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Residences\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Offices\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GOh7XYZ1HZMhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GOh7XYZ1HZM', 'Sound Proof Sliding Door', 'In modern workspace design, there’s a strong focus on transparency and economy of space. All-glass partition walls let daylight into working areas and hallways. Yet planners also need spaces insulated from environmental noise.\r\n\r\nSuperior sound proofing to sound insulation class \r\n\r\nComplementing the transparency of our all-glass partition walls, we now offer an innovative all-glass sliding door system with advanced soundproofing. \r\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '845-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-06-19 04:23:43', '2020-06-19 04:23:43', '', 845, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/845-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
