(1871, 1, '2020-06-24 04:59:19', '2020-06-24 04:59:19', '<h4>Material of Construction</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Aluminum Extrusion\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Insulated Glass\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Insulation Materials \n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h4>Can Block Sound up to</h4>		\n		STC 30db to 52db		\n			<h4>Specialty</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Heavy Duty\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Long Life\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Made as per international Standards\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Easy to install, maintain and operate\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Controls Sound up to high decibel levels\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Complete Customization Option \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										COLOUR TYPE: Anodized and PP COLOUR (PURE POLYESTER)\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										COLOUR OPTION: As per client’s requirement\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h4>Widely Used In Places Like</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Residential Applications\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Commercial Centers\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Industrial Establishments\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Multiplexes\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Malls\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Theaters\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Conference Halls\n									</li>\n						</ul>', 'Sound Proof Tilt and Turn Window', 'Aluminum Tilt and Turn Windows are a great choice when it comes to choosing a window, as it has a perfect blend of intelligent operability and smart aesthetics. These windows provide you the flexibility of choosing it as a source of ventilation or as a standard window. Tilt the top of the sash and open inward at an angle to use it for ventilation purposes else swing the complete sash inward and use it as your standard window. High-grade  Aluminium Frame coupled with Glass of choice offers various configurations of tilt-turn windows.  ', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '846-autosave-v1', '', '', '2020-06-24 04:59:19', '2020-06-24 04:59:19', '', 846, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/846-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
