(1882, 1, '2020-06-30 16:37:56', '2020-06-30 16:37:56', '', 'Sound Proof Partition', 'In modern workspace design, there’s a strong focus on transparency and economy of space. All-glass partition walls let daylight into working areas and hallways. Yet planners also need spaces insulated from environmental noise.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1673-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-06-30 16:37:56', '2020-06-30 16:37:56', '', 1673, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/1673-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
