(1884, 1, '2020-06-30 16:40:04', '2020-06-30 16:40:04', '<h2>Superior sound proofing to sound insulation class </h2>		\n		Complementing the transparency of our all-glass partition walls, we now offer an innovative all-glass sliding door system with advanced soundproofing.', 'Sound Proof Partition', 'In modern workspace design, there’s a strong focus on transparency and economy of space. All-glass partition walls let daylight into working areas and hallways. Yet planners also need spaces insulated from environmental noise.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1673-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-06-30 16:40:04', '2020-06-30 16:40:04', '', 1673, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/1673-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
