(1906, 1, '2020-07-01 19:28:13', '2020-07-01 19:28:13', '<h4>Benefits :  </h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Heavy Duty Hardware\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Best Sound Reduction\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Low Maintenance\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Ease To Use\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Concealed Hardware\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h4>Section Type : Aluminium </h4>		\n			<h4>Glass : DGU 27mm and Single glass 8 mm</h4>		\n			<h4>System Operation : Manual</h4>		\n			<h4>Type : Sliding Folding (Accordion Partition)</h4>		\n			<h4>Widely Used In Places Like</h4>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Hotels\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Restaurants\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Residences\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Offices\n									</li>\n						</ul>', 'Sound Proof Glass Sliding Folding Door', 'Our profiles systems have in all bifold doors and windows Series peripheral compensators, inner frames with embedded or superposed option. Our profile systems for Bifold Doors admit to place different glasses as monolithic, laminated, chambers.\r\n\r\nWide range of aluminium products; aluminium sheets, sandwich panels and aluminium profiles (square, round and rectangular tubes, flat bars, angles and corner tubes) in a standard size.\r\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1677-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-07-01 19:28:13', '2020-07-01 19:28:13', '', 1677, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/1677-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
