(1919, 1, '2020-07-01 19:43:38', '2020-07-01 19:43:38', 'The insulated retractable sliding glass roof systems we provide are well known for their reliability. The roof system can be found in commercial buildings, restaurants, cafés, sport halls, hockey arenas, palaces, private houses, public buildings etc. The customer who is looking for a sliding glass roof is usually have a project visualized, and don’t want to be limited by conventional skylights or roof windows.', 'Motorized Aluminium Frame', 'We are a Manufacturer, Exporter & Supplier of Motorized Sliding Roof. The product offer is high in quality and durability. It is widely used in varied industries for multiple purposes.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '840-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-07-01 19:43:38', '2020-07-01 19:43:38', '', 840, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/840-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
