(1938, 1, '2020-07-01 19:57:51', '2020-07-01 19:57:51', 'The insulated retractable sliding glass roof systems we provide are well known for their reliability. The roof system can be found in commercial buildings, restaurants, cafés, sport halls, hockey arenas, palaces, private houses, public buildings etc. The customer who is looking for a sliding glass roof is usually have a project visualized, and don’t want to be limited by conventional skylights or roof windows.The insulated sliding roof is very versatile and can have multiple functions, such as : 		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Covering an enclosed area, 75% retractable\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Resting on top of structure, 100% retractable\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										A gazebo, used as the full roof structure of the gazebo\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Terrace entrance, can be used as a hatch in the roof to enter the roof area\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										This video explains some of the sliding glass roof features\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>INSTALLATION TIME COMPARISON</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Complete roof with conventional roof windows\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Complete roof without any windows\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Sliding glass roof\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										A normal roof needs a lot of materials and work; wood, roofing felt, insulation material, inner ceiling, windows, sanding, painting, etc.\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Our sliding glass roofs are premade custom, according to your measurements.\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Installation time on site is minimized and saves you money!\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Material Use</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Aluminium Extrusion \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										S.S. Framework\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Indian Made heavy duty cycle motors \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Or\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Imported European Standard Motors\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Weatherproof \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Dust Proof\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										IP Rated\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Overheat Protection\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Types Available </h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Double Slide \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Single Slide\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Framework Types</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Aluminum Extrusion\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Stainless Steel Framework\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Specialty</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Skylight \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Pool Covers\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Double Slide product displays\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										and many other applications depending on client’s requirement\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Widely As</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										Residential Applications\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Commercial Centres\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Industrial establishments\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Malls\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										Conference Halls\n									</li>\n						</ul>', 'Motorized Aluminium Frame', 'We are a Manufacturer, Exporter & Supplier of Motorized Sliding Roof. The product offer is high in quality and durability. It is widely used in varied industries for multiple purposes.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '840-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-07-01 19:57:51', '2020-07-01 19:57:51', '', 840, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/840-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
