n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Indian Made heavy duty cycle motors \r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Or\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Imported European Standard Motors\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Weatherproof \r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Dust Proof\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										IP Rated\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Overheat Protection\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h2>Types Available </h2>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Double Slide \r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Single Slide\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h2>Specialty</h2>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Skylight \r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Pool Covers\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Double Slide product displays\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										and many other applications depending on client’s requirement\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h2>Framework Types</h2>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Aluminum Extrusion\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Stainless Steel Framework\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n			<h2>Widely As</h2>		\r\n					<ul>\r\n							<li >\r\n										Residential Applications\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Commercial Centres\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Industrial establishments\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Malls\r\n									</li>\r\n								<li >\r\n										Conference Halls\r\n									</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TMAZZ08cd-khttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-M1OiThaWV4		\r\n			<h2>SS Framework Motorized Roof Sliding Export Variant </h2>		\r\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GykD_SLJmNE', 'Motorized Stainless Steel Frame', 'We are a Manufacturer, Exporter & Supplier of Motorized Sliding Roof. The product offer is high in quality and durability. It is widely used in varied industries for multiple purposes.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1946-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-07-01 20:05:54', '2020-07-01 20:05:54', '', 1946, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/1946-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
