height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/IMG_20180504_181351-scaled-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/IMG_20180504_181351-scaled-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/IMG_20180504_181351-scaled-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/IMG_20180504_181351-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-frameless-vertical-sliding-system/\">Motorized Frameless Vertical Sliding System</a></h2>		\n	<a role=\"button\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"1670\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"simple\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\">Add to Wishlist</a>		Add to Wishlist\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		NEW<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/sound-proof-partition/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/SoundProofPartition-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/SoundProofPartition-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/SoundProofPartition-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/SoundProofPartition-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/sound-proof-partition/\">Sound Proof Partition</a></h2>		\n	<a role=\"button\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"1673\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"simple\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\">Add to Wishlist</a>		Add to Wishlist\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		NEW<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-barrier-system/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/img2-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/img2-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/img2-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/img2-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-barrier-system/\">Motorized Barrier System</a></h2>		\n	<a role=\"button\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"1683\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"simple\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\">Add to Wishlist</a>		Add to Wishlist\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n</ul>		\n										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-scaled-600x450.jpg 600w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-300x225.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-768x576.jpg 768w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />											\n			<h2>Quality</h2>		\n		Being a quality conscious organization, ‘KIRAN SLIDO CRAFT’ pays a lot of emphasis upon the quality of the product supplied by us. To ensure the exceptional quality of the products offered by us, we have designed an in house, a testing facility for products manufactured by us is tested. As part of the testing procedure, we conduct an Insulation test and sound transmitting test through, which guarantees the quality and performance of the products offered by us.For Motorized system or Automatic System, we have different methods which are recorded in terms of a duty cycle of the system 		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						READ MORE\n					</a>\n			<h4>JOIN THE CLUB</h4>		\n		<p>Get 10% off your first purchase by joining our mailing list, <br />and receive some of the best deals possible.</p>		\n			<!-- Mailchimp for WordPress v4.7.8 - https://wordpress.org/plugins/mailchimp-for-wp/ --><form id=\"mc4wp-form-1\" method=\"post\" data-id=\"102\" data-name=\"Newsletter form\" ><p>\n	<input type=\"email\" name=\"EMAIL\" placeholder=\"email address\" required />\n</p>\n<p>\n	<input type=\"submit\" value=\"JOIN NOW\" />\n</p><label style=\"display: none !important;\">Leave this field empty if you\'re human: <input type=\"text\" name=\"_mc4wp_honeypot\" value=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></label><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_mc4wp_timestamp\" value=\"1594094435\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_mc4wp_form_id\" value=\"102\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_mc4wp_form_element_id\" value=\"mc4wp-form-1\" /></form><!-- / Mailchimp for WordPress Plugin -->		\n			<h4>FOLLOW US</h4>		\n							<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Facebook-f\n									</a>\n							<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Instagram\n									</a>\n							<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Pinterest\n									</a>\n			<h4>Certifications</h4>		\n											<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/3-b-1.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"3-b\">\n							<img width=\"482\" height=\"741\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/3-b-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/3-b-1.jpg 482w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/3-b-1-400x615.jpg 400w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/3-b-1-195x300.jpg 195w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 482px) 100vw, 482px\" />								</a>\n			<h4>Honesty and sustainability</h4>		\n			<h4>CHOSEN WITH CARE</h4>		\n		<p>Our furniture is made from natural materials, selected with consideration <br />and respect for nature, environment and people.</p>		\n			<h4>Solutions for every industry</h4>		\n		<p>Furniture needs vary by market. No matter your industry – government, healthcare, education or business, ours fits you.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						LEARN MORE\n					</a>\n										<img width=\"272\" height=\"442\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/modern-waiting-room-reception-cozy-minimalistic-PTALS5T.jpg\" alt=\"\" />											\n										<img width=\"305\" height=\"232\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/at-the-classroom-P3CFGE2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />											\n										<img width=\"274\" height=\"307\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/the-interior-of-big-empty-modern-office-after-PGYCKPE.jpg\" alt=\"\" />											\n			<h4>STORIES</h4>		\n				<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/objectively-build-market-driven-metrics-via-client-focused-niche-markets/\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n					<img width=\"768\" height=\"403\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/img-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/img-4.jpg 1860w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/img-4-600x315.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />				</a>\n				By <a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/author/admin/\" title=\"Posts by admin\" rel=\"author\">admin</a><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/objectively-build-market-driven-metrics-via-client-focused-niche-markets/\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time datetime=\"2019-06-06T07:58:42+00:00\">June 6, 2019</time></a><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/objectively-build-market-driven-metrics-via-client-focused-niche-markets/#respond\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" > <use href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/themes/rey/assets/images/icons/icon-sprite.svg#rey-icon-comments\" xlink:href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/themes/rey/assets/images/icons/icon-sprite.svg#rey-icon-comments\"></use> </svg> 0</a>  on Objectively build market-driven metrics via client-focused niche markets<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-admin/post.php?post=981&#038;action=edit\">Edit Objectively build market-driven metrics via client-focused niche markets</a>				\n			<h3><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/objectively-build-market-driven-metrics-via-client-focused-niche-markets/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Objectively build market-driven metrics via client-focused niche markets</a></h3>\n				<p>Assertively whiteboard error-free growth strategies and intuitive leadership. Dynamically pursue interdependent supply chains after quality applications. Dramatically build cost effective [&hellip;]</p>\n				<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/dynamically-pursue-interdependent-supply-chains-after-quality-applications/\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n					<img width=\"768\" height=\"461\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/home-slide-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/home-slide-1.jpg 1796w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/home-slide-1-600x360.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />				</a>\n				By <a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/author/admin/\" title=\"Posts by admin\" rel=\"author\">admin</a><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/dynamically-pursue-interdependent-supply-chains-after-quality-applications/\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time datetime=\"2019-06-06T07:55:06+00:00\">June 6, 2019</time></a><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/dynamically-pursue-interdependent-supply-chains-after-quality-applications/#respond\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" > <use href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/themes/rey/assets/images/icons/icon-sprite.svg#rey-icon-comments\" xlink:href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/themes/rey/assets/images/icons/icon-sprite.svg#rey-icon-comments\"></use> </svg> 0</a>  on Dynamically pursue interdependent supply chains after quality applications<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-admin/post.php?post=975&#038;action=edit\">Edit Dynamically pursue interdependent supply chains after quality applications</a>				\n			<h3><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiran