(1996, 1, '2020-07-07 04:04:10', '2020-07-07 04:04:10', 'Kiran Slido Craft, a sole-proprietary concern was established in 1985 by Mr. Tapan Chakraborty. We strive to provide best quality products and services following the Belief of Make In India for past 35 years.We provide Manufacturing and Services for Motorized Sliding Systems and Acoustic System (Doors, Windows, Partitions). From Customized solutions for various individual clients to industries, we have been Engineering our products to suit their requirements. This supports our moto: “To bring Peace and Tranquility to your Home”  We have been growing and improving our products for You, our customers.\nWe are a leading products and manufacturing company, we understand the change in current needs and strive hard to make that change reach You, our customers without compromising on Quality.\nWe offer high-quality products that reflect our goal to bring our customers leading technologies in Interior Engineering. 		\n										<img width=\"1699\" height=\"1536\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p.jpg 1699w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-600x542.jpg 600w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-300x271.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-1024x926.jpg 1024w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-768x694.jpg 768w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/P_20160408_131344_1_HDR_p-1536x1389.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1699px) 100vw, 1699px\" />											\n										<img width=\"960\" height=\"447\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/slidingroof.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/slidingroof.jpg 960w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/slidingroof-600x279.jpg 600w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/slidingroof-300x140.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/slidingroof-768x358.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" />											\n										<img width=\"176\" height=\"320\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/top-channel-sliding-doors-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/top-channel-sliding-doors-2.jpg 176w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/top-channel-sliding-doors-2-165x300.jpg 165w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 176px) 100vw, 176px\" />											\n		<p>Our sole purpose is to bring best quality products and reasonable price to You, our customers.</p>\n<p>Our vision is to bring best and latest product in field of soundproof and acoustic for our customers with no compromise in quality, we strive to continuously improve manufacturing technologies like Aluminum Soundproof Doors/window and Acoustic movable wall partition Motorized Roof Sliding, Motorized Vertical Sliding Windows and Motorized Barriers and sliding systems so that our customers can get the best quality products.</p>\n<p>We are Certified by NSIC and MSME, 2015.</p>		\n			<h2>Our Services</h2>		\n										<img width=\"1000\" height=\"840\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/made-in-india.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/20