actured By Us.We have increased our service\'s strength and improved our service time.Our company has been standing in India for 35 years (as of 2020) and is known for its International Quality Products and Services Kiran Slido Craft\'s vision is to continuously improve Aluminum Sliding Door and Windows Manufacturing technologies and quality. Thanks to our best quality technologies and special designs for complete Sliding engineering products and services. We are among the few in the world that can provide customized products and services to suit every Sliding Door needs.\n										<img width=\"1000\" height=\"840\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/made-in-india.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/made-in-india.png 1000w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/made-in-india-600x504.png 600w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/made-in-india-300x252.png 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/made-in-india-768x645.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" />											\n			<h1>Our Story</h1>		\n		<p>Appropriately develop high-quality interfaces vis-a-vis granular e-markets. Globally integrate accurate collaboration and idea-sharing after effective web services. Seamlessly streamline bleeding-edge paradigms for technically.</p>https://vimeo.com/93037765<p>Est. 2001        15 Designers       Worldwide Delivery</p><p>Appropriately develop high-quality interfaces vis-a-vis granular e-markets. Globally integrate accurate collaboration and idea-sharing after effective web services. Seamlessly streamline bleeding-edge paradigms for technically.</p>		\n										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"792\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/about-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/about-1.jpg 1200w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/about-1-600x464.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />											\n		<p>Appropriately develop high-quality interfaces vis-a-vis granular e-markets. Globally integrate accurate collaboration and idea-sharing after effective web services. Seamlessly streamline bleeding-edge paradigms for technically sound ROI.&nbsp;</p><p>Globally integrate accurate collaboration and idea-sharing after effective web services. Seamlessly streamline bleeding-edge paradigms for technically sound ROI.</p>		\n										<img src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/signature.svg\" alt=\"\" />', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '607-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-07-07 04:06:21', '2020-07-07 04:06:21', '', 607, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/607-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
