and Turn Window</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/sound-proof-top-hung-window/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/soundproofaluminumwindowhungarched-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/soundproofaluminumwindowhungarched-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/soundproofaluminumwindowhungarched-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/soundproofaluminumwindowhungarched-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/sound-proof-top-hung-window/\">Sound Proof Top Hung Window</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n</ul>		\n			<h4>MOTORIZED SYSTEM</h4>		\n			<p>Casual multifunctional sofabeds with head elevation: a comfortable motorized system at daytime transforms into changes to a very comfortable bed at night.</p>		\n		<ul><li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-sliding-window/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-3-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-3-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-3-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_151311385_HDR-3-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-sliding-window/\">Motorized Sliding Window</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-stainless-steel-frame/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/MotorizedAluminiumFrame1-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/MotorizedAluminiumFrame1-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/MotorizedAluminiumFrame1-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/MotorizedAluminiumFrame1-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-stainless-steel-frame/\">Motorized Stainless Steel Frame</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-aluminium-frame/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/MotorizedAluminiumFrame5-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/MotorizedAluminiumFrame5-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/MotorizedAluminiumFrame5-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/MotorizedAluminiumFrame5-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-aluminium-frame/\">Motorized Aluminium Frame</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-sound-proof-window/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_150845358_HDR-3-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_150845358_HDR-3-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_150845358_HDR-3-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_20160602_150845358_HDR-3-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-sound-proof-window/\">Motorized Sound Proof Window</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-vertical-sliding-windows/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/f1-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/f1-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/f1-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/f1-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-vertical-sliding-windows/\">Motorized Vertical Sliding Window</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-frameless-vertical-sliding-system/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/IMG_20180504_181351-scaled-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/IMG_20180504_181351-scaled-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/IMG_20180504_181351-scaled-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/IMG_20180504_181351-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-frameless-vertical-sliding-system/\">Motorized Frameless Vertical Sliding System</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-barrier-system/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/img2-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/img2-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/img2-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/img2-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-barrier-system/\">Motorized Barrier System</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n<li>\n		<a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-sliding-gates/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-sliding-gate-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-sliding-gate-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-sliding-gate-100x100.jpg 100w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-sliding-gate-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>		\n	<h2><a href=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/product/motorized-sliding-gates/\">Motorized Sliding Gates</a></h2>		\n		<!-- /.rey-productLoop-footer -->\n	</li>\n</ul>		\n										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-scaled-600x450.jpg 600w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-300x225.jpg 300w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-768x576.jpg 768w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/motorized-roof-sliding-2-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />											\n			<h2>Quality</h2>		\n		Being a quality conscious organization, ‘KIRAN SLIDO CRAFT’ pays a lot of emphasis upon the quality of the product supplied by us. To ensure the exceptional quality of the products offered by us, we have designed an in house, a testing facility for products manufactured by us is tested. As part of the testing procedure, we conduct an Insulation test and sound transmitting test through, which guarantees the quality and performance of the products offered by us.For Motorized system or Automatic System, we have different methods which are recorded in terms of a duty cycle of the system 		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						READ MORE\n					</a>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-08-21 04:07:48', '2020-08-21 04:07:48', '', 6, 'http://www.iknowledgesolution.com/work/kiranslidocraft/6-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
